            "text": "Дх҃ъ ст҃ыи на єрея и покрїєт єго. реч поп: „Вън’мѣм ст҃оє възно-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              114,
              985,
              942,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-145-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 64,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-25",
            "text": "шенїє“, тогда возмет сѧ агнец бж҃їи и станет на въздꙋсѣ, сънїи-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              114,
              1020,
              942,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-145-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 63,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-26",
            "text": "дета два Херꙋвима [sic!], станета ѡкрⷭть трапезы. И реч поп:",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              114,
              1055,
              942,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-145-image-20261127",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 19,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              },
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-145-image-20261127",
                "start": 19,
                "end": 23,
                "language": "la",
                "script": "Latn",
                "uncertain": false
              },
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-iv-145-image-20261127",
                "start": 23,
                "end": 60,
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "liturgy-line-27",
            "text": "„Побѣдноую пѣс ти єсть“⁵), тогда възмоут сѧ Херꙋвима поюща,",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              114,
              1091,
              942,
              32
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
